sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant UI as Streamlit
  participant Service as Application services
  participant DB as SQLite
  Student->>UI: Sign in
  UI->>Service: Authenticate credentials
  Service->>DB: Verify salted password hash
  DB-->>Service: Linked student account
  UI->>Service: Request dashboard
  Service->>DB: Query only linked student records
  DB-->>Service: Academic history
  Service-->>UI: Period scores, trend and intervention reasons
  UI-->>Student: Own dashboard and charts
